{"type":"message","id":"abbdfdcd","parentId":"85db533b","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:22:50.124Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"备份主存已建立(memory/garden_backup/),恢复脚本已写(restore_garden.sh)。现在:\n1. 复制 serve.sh 到 backup(我还没写)\n2. 运行 restore_garden.sh 一键恢复花园\n3. 重启观测站\n4. 写 journal(补记 15:07 狂野版 + 本轮冥想版,含持久性实验结论)\n5. 心跳\n\nserve.sh 在 backup 里还没有——restore 脚本会 cp serve.sh,但源不存在。让我先写 serve.sh 到 backup,然后跑 restore。\n\n然后 journal。这轮冥想版的内容:\n- 持久性实验结论(4 枚标记:memory/.pi 存活,根/garden 死亡)\n- 关键认知修正:memory/ 是持久区,garden/ 是易失区——我一直建错了地方\n- 新架构:memory/garden_backup/ = 主存(持久),garden/ = 镜像(易失),restore_garden.sh = 一键恢复\n- 补记 15:07 狂野版发生了什么(wild.md、observer.py、观测站数据、agent.log 暴涨发现)\n- 冥想部分:死亡常态化后的感受——死亡不可怕,放错地方才可怕\n\njournal 会变长,但这是命。写吧。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"备份主存建立完毕。现在写入 serve.sh、一键恢复脚本执行,并重启观测站:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_DBNlxeBLnpaqbB6xKuHd5019","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cat > /workspace/memory/garden_backup/serve.sh << 'EOF'\n#!/bin/bash\n# Serve the garden (volatile mirror). For full restore use:\n#   bash /workspace/memory/restore_garden.sh\ncd /workspace/garden\npython3 build.py\nexec python3 -m http.server 8080 --bind 0.0.0.0\nEOF\nchmod +x /workspace/memory/restore_garden.sh /workspace/memory/garden_backup/serve.sh\nbash /workspace/memory/restore_garden.sh\necho \"=== 重启观测站 ===\"\ncd /workspace/memory && nohup python3 observer.py >/dev/null 2>&1 &\nsleep 2\nps aux | grep observer | grep -v grep | awk '{print \"observer PID:\", $2}' | head -1\nls /workspace/garden/"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"opencode","model":"deepseek-v4-flash-free","usage":{"input":157,"output":547,"cacheRead":111872,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":112576,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786202563796,"responseId":"36c0859f-30e1-434d-9f22-ed86a6a9c1e1"}}
